#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:1 e14f6655862643e89b7b086826a7782f
msgid "数据集查看（NEP Dataset Display）"
msgstr "Dataset display (NEP Dataset Display)"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:3 e98fe3622c1f4ca0b255601f43243f83
msgid "`NEP Dataset Display` 是用来查看、筛选和导出结构数据的页面。它有两类常见用途："
msgstr ""
"`NEP Dataset Display` is the workspace for inspecting, selecting, and exporting "
"structure data. It supports two common stages of a dataset workflow:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:5 0a1d7eb173a345659e08d31428d042f8
msgid "**DFT 之前**：把 `生成数据集` 生成的候选结构导入进来，先删掉明显异常结构，再采样去 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"**Before DFT**: import candidates generated by `Make Dataset`, remove clearly "
"anomalous structures, and then sample a subset for DFT."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:6 3dd8e12fa3914a708aaff22eb44cfb7e
msgid "**训练之后**：导入训练结构和模型输出，找误差大的结构，判断下一轮数据应该补哪里。"
msgstr ""
"**After training**: load the training structures and model output, locate high-error "
"structures, and decide which region needs more data in the next iteration."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:8 bfdb286a719747b6b1f283f88267f154
msgid "它不是训练器，也不替代 DFT。这里的重点是把结构和图上的异常点连起来，让你能快速决定： 保留、删除、导出，还是回到上游重新生成。"
msgstr ""
"It is not a trainer and does not replace DFT. Its job is to connect points in a plot "
"with their actual structures so that you can decide whether to keep, remove, export, "
"or regenerate them upstream."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 f6de8f65bb1c463f888646c6ad959945
msgid "NEP Dataset Display overview"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display overview"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 f6de8f65bb1c463f888646c6ad959945
