msgid "输入"
msgstr "Data import"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 91c48bb74bfb4d27894d36f94f88bde8
msgid "什么时候用"
msgstr "When to use it"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 8e2839c91e62452e82724724adc25093
msgid "你会看到什么"
msgstr "What you can inspect"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 bd47f783b32a4f289e260b4170b91ce9
msgid "候选结构 `xyz` / `extxyz`"
msgstr "Candidate structures in `xyz` / `extxyz`"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 31338fd9052f4e19bb5f6fc8071abe62
msgid "`生成数据集` 刚生成结构后"
msgstr "Immediately after `Make Dataset` generates structures"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 4945a05a791944e39d3ef61d06474a5f
msgid "结构视图、组成、标签、预测或几何异常"
msgstr "Structure view, composition, labels, predictions, and geometric problems"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 c0cb691cdb09489c8120888fe0aa875d
msgid "训练结构 + `nep.txt`"
msgstr "Training structures + `nep.txt`"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 92490246dd8946ddabf264a2e8146118
msgid "想用模型快速预筛或回看预测"
msgstr "For a quick model-based prescreen or to revisit predictions"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 d68c9377c69c46f9b31a0043531423f6
msgid "能量、力、应力等预测结果"
msgstr "Predicted energy, force, stress, and related quantities"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 c7f3fef7fa754bf9acbef12ca62e1995
msgid "训练输出目录"
msgstr "Training-output directory"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 7c5a95233e104a52956b58546b1cc34f
msgid "GPUMD 训练结束后"
msgstr "After a GPUMD training run"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22 366bd12276a143dabb7af2bf084de2bd
msgid "预测-标签散点、误差最大结构、可导出的子集"
msgstr "Prediction-versus-label plots, largest-error structures, and exportable subsets"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:37 9d2ad19a015441fba84115f8c74e7698
msgid "入口是顶部 `Open`。如果只是看一批候选结构，直接打开 `xyz` 文件；如果要回看完整训练结果， 打开包含训练输出的目录或对应文件。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Open` in the title bar. Open an `xyz` file to inspect a candidate collection. "
"Open the training-output directory or the relevant output file when reviewing a "
"complete training run."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:40 ddb2af36c7944ceda0e5515918eeaa96
msgid "第一次应该看哪里"
msgstr "What to inspect first"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:42 9f69e40e7c184a3da57fd0b731d3e923
msgid "先看三个区域："
msgstr "Start with these three areas:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:44 c2c8b766212f4f8896b658bc046cd6cd
msgid "**误差图或分布图**：先找离群点，不要一上来逐个翻结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Error or distribution plots**: locate outliers before browsing structures one by "
"one."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:45 ac186acd8f1c4e898427bfa75cfa19e3
msgid "**结构视图**：点中图上的结构后，看右侧是否有过近原子、不合理配位、奇怪表面或异常磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"**Structure view**: select a point, then check the structure on the right for atoms "
"that are too close, unreasonable coordination, unintended surfaces, or unusual "
"magnetic moments."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:46 575b82db609d4f8d826f48485705b137
msgid "**状态行**：关注 `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Unsel / Rej`，确认当前删掉、选中和保留的数量。"
msgstr ""
"**Status line**: use `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Unsel / Rej` to confirm how many "
"structures are retained, removed, selected, or rejected."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:48 c7bfd2a745804aacac6eac69a66c947a
msgid ""
"如果你正在处理 `生成数据集` 的候选结构，建议先看完整流程： [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](../workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If you are processing candidates from `Make Dataset`, read the complete workflow "
"first: [Clean candidate structures before DFT](../workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md)."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:51 8032b09db10548a6b23b71c07cbc3dd3
msgid "从这里打开训练集评估"
msgstr "Open Training Set Audit from this page"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:53 15333d2b8f53402a918ca2045621474c
msgid "加载数据后，打开顶部 `Save` 分裂菜单，点击 `评估当前数据集`。软件会检查当前活动结构，并进入「训练集评估」的概览页。"
msgstr ""
"After loading data, open the `Save` split menu and choose `Check current dataset`. "
"NepTrainKit audits the active structures and opens the Training Set Audit overview."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:55 4e1953510425459ab307b60baf4bf4b5
msgid ""
"如果只想查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差的分布，可以点击左侧图表工具栏中的 `查看数据分布`。它会直接打开同一页面的「数据地图 → "
"数据分布」，点击柱形分箱后仍可把对应结构选回 `NEP Dataset Display`。"
msgstr ""
"To inspect only the distribution of energy, force, virial, predictions, or errors, "
"click `Explore distributions` in the plot toolbar. This opens `Data map → Data "
"distribution` on the same audit page. Selecting a histogram bin can still send the "
"matching structures back to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:57 c3ac71772c5442909b0e62e67e205e06
msgid ""
"训练集评估还可以按精确组分查看结构数量，并对全部结构分析 FCC、HCP、BCC、L1₂、Laves 相结构，以及 FM、AFM、FiM、PM-like 等 "
"`spin:R:3` 磁类型。完整用法、判据、占比视图和限制见 [训练集评估](training-set-assessment.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit also groups structures by exact composition and analyzes FCC, HCP,"
" BCC, L1₂, and Laves structural phases together with `spin:R:3` magnetic types such "
"as FM, AFM, FiM, and PM-like. See [Training Set Audit](training-set-assessment.md) "
"for the workflow, criteria, share views, and limitations."

