#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:79 ca5fb2c501654e078c0fd7280dbb2deb
msgid ""
"如果你不知道按钮图标对应哪个功能，直接展开本页左侧目录。目录按照软件页面从上到下排列： "
"顶部数据入口、左侧主图区、右侧结构区、筛选栏、底部状态栏。参数解释和执行结果都放在对应功能下面。"
msgstr ""
"If you do not recognize a button icon, expand the table of contents on the left. It "
"follows the page from top to bottom: data inputs, the main plot, the structure view, "
"the filter bar, and the status bar. Each tool's parameters and results are documented"
" below it."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:82 bd8127a84bab402dbb008586e5481a3e
msgid "候选结构清洗时怎么用"
msgstr "Clean a candidate pool"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:84 5a6d23b8396741dfaa29d94f683252ed
msgid "候选结构清洗的重点不是追求预测精度，而是先剔除明显坏样本："
msgstr ""
"The purpose of candidate cleaning is not to maximize prediction accuracy. It is to "
"remove clearly bad samples before they consume DFT resources:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:86 06d19813ba6d461398802ee903d0bab9
msgid "打开 `生成数据集` 导出的候选结构。"
msgstr "Open the candidate structures exported by `Make Dataset`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:87 55b73023dcc64ddcb7349abf6cd47e49
msgid "用结构视图和 `Finding non-physical structures` 找几何异常。"
msgstr ""
"Use the structure view and `Finding non-physical structures` to find geometric "
"anomalies."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:88 66ad45ffe06244cfb8ee3dbb49ba3ac3
msgid "如果有可用 NEP 模型，再看预测力、能量或分布长尾。"
msgstr ""
"If a usable NEP model is available, inspect predicted forces, energies, and long "
"distribution tails."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:89 c0b439b139494fd3b605224232a616c2
msgid "选中异常结构后删除，或单独导出做记录。"
msgstr "Delete selected problematic structures or export them separately for investigation."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:90 2d7428c9419946419601d15f54359b4c
msgid "导出清洗后的候选池，再做 FPS 或其他代表性采样。"
msgstr ""
"Export the cleaned candidate pool, then apply FPS or another representative-sampling "
"method."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:92 5cfc5177166a42808fd81ced52eee3ac
msgid "这里要避免一个顺序错误：不要把未清洗的候选池直接交给 FPS。FPS 只看描述符距离， 坏结构可能因为“离得远”被选中。"
msgstr ""
"Do not send an uncleaned candidate pool directly to FPS. FPS measures descriptor "
"distance; a bad structure can be selected precisely because it lies far from the rest"
" of the pool."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:95 db4d66fc363c4e38a711f638a4e38873
msgid "训练结果回看时怎么用"
msgstr "Review training results"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:97 29fbb7e797054ddfaee0c71fb312022e
msgid "训练结束后，这个页面更像诊断台："
msgstr "After training, use this page as a diagnostic workspace:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:99 ed359acda77b41e29108f9bf4011cc95
msgid "打开训练输出。"
msgstr "Open the training output."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:100 f0e921ffd0ec478b80b430d1ce9c181d
msgid "先看 energy / force / stress / virial 的散点图。"
msgstr "Inspect the energy, force, stress, and virial scatter plots first."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:101 f0525eb3a9c64e329af1a9fd6d3a83ee
msgid "用 `Find Max Error Point` 找误差最大的结构。"
msgstr "Use `Find Max Error Point` to locate the largest errors."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:102 725b47a8c4664b4f84c7631404b3f387
msgid "在右侧查看结构和 `Config_type`，判断误差来源。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the corresponding structure and `Config_type` on the right to determine where"
" the error comes from."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:103 d2eca06c443f4502a2529b8174e6f9d4
msgid "导出这些结构，作为下一轮补数据或排查 DFT 标签的入口。"
msgstr ""
"Export those structures as input for the next data iteration or for checking the "
"original DFT labels."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:105 6feb58c64b464a8682a9d99beaa4971e
msgid "判断时不要只看一个总 RMSE。更有用的是确认误差集中在哪类结构： 缺陷、表面、应变、高能构型、某个元素组合，还是某个生成卡片的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Do not stop at a single aggregate RMSE. Determine where the error is concentrated: "
"defects, surfaces, strained cells, high-energy structures, a particular element "
"combination, or output from a particular generation card."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:108 83254cee4ed64fecbe996cf8ca898471
msgid "搜索模式"
msgstr "Search modes"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:110 25453a440c5b4a4aae235c67795200b7
msgid "`tag`：基于 `Config_type` 正则匹配。"
msgstr "`tag`: regular-expression matching against `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:111 f58bfe597b8c47e1ad95def840776e13
msgid "`formula`：基于化学式正则匹配。"
msgstr "`formula`: regular-expression matching against chemical formulas."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:112 e9f17d7218d94801953ef7e44e5ecbc5
msgid "`elements`：元素集合语法，例如 `+Fe -O`。"
msgstr "`elements`: element-set syntax such as `+Fe -O`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:113 aecc05f5ce0d4c8aac2e3219c4bb159c
msgid "`expression`：基于结构级表达式筛选，支持 `natoms`、元素统计、能量、力、应力、virial 和 `atomic.<name>`。"
msgstr ""
"`expression`: structure-level expressions using `natoms`, element counts and "
"fractions, energy, force, stress, virial, and `atomic.<name>`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:115 10bb61692f45468a98d94544cb2b4f0a
msgid "`expression` 的完整语法、字段规则和示例见 [筛选栏：按标签、元素和表达式找结构](nep-display-filter.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Filter bar: find structures by tags, elements, and expressions](nep-display-"
"filter.md) for the complete `expression` syntax, field rules, and examples."

